  m_Name: GetDungeonCore
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  initialDialog:
  - "\"Adventurer, our realm teeters on the brink of darkness. The ancient Dungeon
    Core\u2014our source of life and magic\u2014has been stolen by a sinister force
    lurking in the dungeon depths.\""
  - '"Legends whisper that only the bravest can challenge the evil that guards this
    core. Our only hope lies in a hero who dares to venture into the Dungeon of Shadows."'
  - '"Your quest is to enter the dungeon, face the monstrous boss, and reclaim the
    Dungeon Core. With the core restored, light shall return to our land."'
  - '"Will you accept this challenge and bring back the lost heart of our realm?"'
  acceptOption: '"I will retrieve the Dungeon Core."'
  acceptAnswer: '"Your courage inspires us all. Venture forth, defeat the boss, and
    return with the core to restore our land!"'
  declineOption: I cannot face such darkness.
  declineAnswer: A sorrowful decision... but remember, the fate of our realm hangs
    in the balance. Should you change your mind, our hope remains with you.
  comebackAfterDecline: 
  comebackInProgress: 
  comebackCompleted: 
  finalWords: 
  coinReward: 500
  rewardItem1: LargePotion
  rewardItem2: LargePotion
